  "ruleText": "CHAPTER En 200 PROCEDURAL RULES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 12-P:5, IV and V\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14179, effective 1-22-25, adopted chapter En 200 by essentially readopting with amendment Puc 201.05 from Document #10099, eff 3-20-12, as some of the authority for Puc 200 was transferred to the Department of Energy pursuant to 2021, 91:187, which adopted RSA 12-P.",
